# Hysteria2 Sample Collection

## Protocol: Hysteria2

### Sample 1: Basic Configuration
```json
{
  "name": "hysteria2-basic",
  "format": "uri",
  "link": "hysteria2://test-password@example.com:443?sni=example.com#Hysteria2-Basic",
  "description": "Standard Hysteria2 configuration",
  "expected_ir": {
    "protocol": "hysteria2",
    "name": "Hysteria2-Basic",
    "server": {
      "host": "example.com",
      "port": 443
    },
    "security": {
      "type": "tls",
      "sni": "example.com"
    },
    "proto": {
      "password": "test-password",
      "udp": true
    }
  }
}
```

### Sample 2: With Obfuscation
```json
{
  "name": "hysteria2-obfs",
  "format": "uri",
  "link": "hysteria2://test-password@example.com:443?sni=example.com&obfs=salamander&obfs-password=obfs-secret#Hysteria2-Obfs",
  "description": "Hysteria2 with salamander obfuscation",
  "expected_ir": {
    "protocol": "hysteria2",
    "name": "Hysteria2-Obfs",
    "server": {
      "host": "example.com",
      "port": 443
    },
    "security": {
      "type": "tls",
      "sni": "example.com"
    },
    "proto": {
      "password": "test-password",
      "obfs": "salamander",
      "obfs_password": "obfs-secret",
      "udp": true
    }
  }
}
```

### Sample 3: With Port Hopping
```json
{
  "name": "hysteria2-ports",
  "format": "uri",
  "link": "hysteria2://test-password@example.com:10000-20000?sni=example.com#Hysteria2-Ports",
  "description": "Hysteria2 with port hopping",
  "expected_ir": {
    "protocol": "hysteria2",
    "name": "Hysteria2-Ports",
    "server": {
      "host": "example.com",
      "port": 443
    },
    "security": {
      "type": "tls",
      "sni": "example.com"
    },
    "proto": {
      "password": "test-password",
      "port_hopping": "10000-20000",
      "udp": true
    }
  }
}
```
